A [[Sentience|sentient]] '''species''' was seen on [[Tenoo]] during the [[High Republic Era]].<ref name="The Young Jedi" /> The [[species]] was also seen on [[Rex Strata]]<ref name="JatT">{{YJA|The Jedi and the Thief}}</ref>, [[Batuu]]<ref name="ToSS">{{YJA|The Tale of Short Spire}}</ref>, [[Starlight Beacon]]<ref name="PatP">{{YJA|The Prince and the Pirate}}</ref>, [[Hazun]]<ref name="SecretShip">{{YJA|The Secret Ship}}</ref>, [[Yarrum]]<ref name="TowerRun">{{YJA|Tower Run}}</ref>, and an unidentified desert world<ref name="Rustler">{{YJA|The Rustler Roundup}}</ref>.

{{Species-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The species first appeared in "[[The Young Jedi]]," the first part of the [[The Young Jedi / Yoda's Mission|first episode]],<ref name="The Young Jedi" /> and "[[Nash's Race Day]]," the first part of the [[Nash's Race Day / The Lost Jedi Ship|second episode]], of the [[Disney+]] and [[Disney Junior]] animated series ''[[Star Wars: Young Jedi Adventures]]''{{'}} [[Young Jedi Adventures Season One|first season]],<ref name="Race Day">{{YJA|Nash's Race Day}}</ref> which were shown exclusively on [[April 8]], [[2023]], during [[Celebration Europe (2023)|Celebration Europe]],<ref name="Celebration">{{SW|url=news/swce-2023-panel-schedule|text=Plan Ahead with the ''Star Wars'' Celebration Europe 2023 Panel Schedule}}</ref> before a wider release on [[May 4]], [[2023]].<ref name="D23 May">{{D23|url=everything-new-you-can-stream-on-disney-in-may-2023|text=Everything New You Can Stream on Disney+ in May 2023}}</ref> [[Casey Straka]] was responsible for the design concept of the species.<ref name="Concept">{{Twitter|username=madidrawsthings|url=status/1757920377869889877|name=[[Madi Hodges]]|date=2024-02-15|quote=Casey Straka|archiveurl=https://archive.ph/Aoavb|archivefile=File:MadiHodges-SmallSpeciesConcept-Twitter.png}} {{C|In response to: [An image of the short species seen in ''Star Wars: Young Jedi Adventures''] Sentient Star Wars Species that are unidentified as of this tweet Day 489: this short species!}}</ref>

